<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>LUV? (feat. Anne-Marie)</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v1">Aitch, Anne-Marie</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">LUV? (feat. Anne-Marie)</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">4kSXfaTJzXGkEdGBQBl0MB</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1">9 Contributors</p><p ttm:agent="v1">LUV? Lyrics</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Intro: Anne-Marie]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Uh, mm</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus: Anne-Marie]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">What you know about love? All I know is I can't be arsed</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You've had a little too much, what's your name again? I forgot</p><p ttm:agent="v1">If you wanna be useful, huh, go to the bar and fill my glass</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I'm done tryna catch feelings, all I wanna do is party hard</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 1: Aitch]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Woah, slow down, babe (Woo)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I'm just tryna get to know ya, you know my game</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I can really keep you warm when it's cold out, babe</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, I'm from up North, but I go down, babe (Woo)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">So, what's your number, name and your addy?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Know you're from down South, let me take you to Manny</p><p ttm:agent="v1">My new goal in life's to be making you happy</p><p ttm:agent="v1">What you drinkin'? Wray or a Maggie?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Pre-Chorus: Anne-Marie &amp;</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Aitch</p><p ttm:agent="v1">]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You're tryin' a little too much for me if I'm honest (</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Huh? What you mean? What you mean?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I don't wanna be harsh, but you can't take a hint (</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Aight, tell me how you feel</p><p ttm:agent="v1">)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Have you really come up to me to chat rubbish? (</p><p ttm:agent="v1">What? I'm just tryna gеt to know ya</p><p ttm:agent="v1">; yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I'm still waiting for my drink (</p><p ttm:agent="v1">What?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">), ayy (</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Huh</p><p ttm:agent="v1">)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus: Anne-Marie &amp;</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Aitch</p><p ttm:agent="v1">]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">What you know about love? All I know is I can't be arsеd</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You've had a little too much, what's your name again? I forgot</p><p ttm:agent="v1">If you wanna be useful, huh (</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1">), go to the bar and fill my glass</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I'm done tryna catch feelings (Woo), all I wanna do is party hard[Verse 2: Aitch]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Alright, true say I've had a couple of drinks (Yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And between me and you, I threw up in the sink (Ugh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">But I'm tryna find out if you're looking to link</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Know your friends don't agree, but fuck what they think (Fuck 'em all)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Don't worry, I don't kiss and tell (Shh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And you ain't gotta stress when you're with Big Shell (Turn up)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Make sure your nails did and your drip's Chanel (Woo)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Treat me nice and you might get a whip as well (Skrrt)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Got them good hips, good lips, pretty blue eyes</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Might have pushed it, but fuck it, I'm kissing you twice (Mwah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Come with me, we can live a new life</p><p ttm:agent="v1">If you ain't got a crib, then I'm giving you mine (Hahaha)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Hold my hand, baby, walk with me (Walk with me)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I'm a big boy, why you being short with me?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Come and get another drink, you can tell me what you think</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Are you really tryna link? Baby, talk to me (Woo)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Bridge: Anne-Marie &amp;</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Aitch</p><p ttm:agent="v1">]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Ooh, spillin' shit all on my brand-new shoes</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Hush your mouth 'cause this my tune</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Ooh, say you understand my point of view</p><p ttm:agent="v1">But I don't think you do (</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Huh?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus: Anne-Marie,</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Anne-Marie &amp; Aitch</p><p ttm:agent="v1">]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">What you know about love?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">All I know is I can't be arsed</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You've had a little too much,</p><p ttm:agent="v1">what's your name again? I forgot</p><p ttm:agent="v1">If you wanna be useful, huh,</p><p ttm:agent="v1">go to the bar and fill my glass</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I'm done tryna catch feelings,</p><p ttm:agent="v1">all I wanna do is party hard[Outro: Anne-Marie &amp; Aitch]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">All I wanna do is party hard</p></div></body></tt>